ndation stub)\\\",\\n28\\t  });\\n29\\t}\\n30\\t\"}]},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"8d6d1f63-412d-4ec0-a1d3-5b6b004b453c\",\"uuid\":\"73e21cc1-702e-467a-9b63-7edd1fc24eac\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-14T10:45:17.880Z\",\"tool_use_result\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"file\":{\"filePath\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/pi-lhc/src/verify/replay.ts\",\"content\":\"import type { MessageEventInput, ThreadRef } from \\\"lhc\\\";\\nimport type { AgentMessage } from \\\"../pi/types.js\\\";\\n\\n// AC-6.1, AC-6.2. Replay a recorded corpus through the converter into a temp\\n// thread and compare read-back to the fixture expectation; the same corpus\\n// replayed twice yields identical read-back. Story 3.\\n\\n/** A loaded corpus: synthetic PI source messages (the stand-in until M0\\n *  delivers recordings) paired with the expected LHC intake events. Both\\n *  `verify/replay` and the corpus fixtures consume this shape. */\\nexport interface Corpus {\\n  name: string;\\n  source: AgentMessage[];\\n  expected: MessageEventInput[];\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ReplayResult {\\n  matches: boolean;\\n  diff?: string;\\n}\\n\\n/** Fail-closed until Story 3 — `matches:false`, never a faked pass (story\\n *  §Anti-Shim: no stub reports successful replay). */\\nexport function replayCorpus(corpus: Corpus, threadRef: ThreadRef): Promise<ReplayResult> {\\n  return Promise.resolve({\\n    matches: false,\\n    diff: \\\"verify.replayCorpus is not implemented yet (Epic 1 foundation stub)\\\",\\n  });\\n}\\n\",\"numLines\":30,\"startLine\":1,\"totalLines\":30}}}\n{\"type\":\"stream_event\",\"event\":{\"type\":\"content_block_delta\",\"index\":3,\"delta\":{\"type\":\"input_json_delta\",\"partial_json\":\"\"}},\"session_id\":\"8d6d1f63-412d-4ec0-a1d3-5b6b004b453c\",\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"uuid\":\"b5ac66c9-3038-4b7d-97dd-d8b2015d167e\"}\n{\"type\":\"stream_event\",\"event\":{\"type\":\"content_block_delta\",\"index\":3,\"delta\":{\"type\":\"input_jso